[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21061.19, "timestamp": "05:51:01", "text": "急。這不是扭蛋遊戲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21091.75, "timestamp": "05:51:31", "text": "我的意思是，雖然是抽卡遊戲，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21095.91, "timestamp": "05:51:35", "text": "沒有陷阱。  雖然是動漫風格的《星際戰甲》，但沒關係。我可以慢慢來。  里夫。  好的。所以，這是這款飾品的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 21112.783, "timestamp": "05:51:52", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ-r4KpS3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ-r4KpS3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21119.27, "timestamp": "05:51:59", "text": "我喜歡這些化妝品。  我想要這隻紫色蝴蝶或那副眼鏡。"}]